{"skill":{"slug":"cctv-news-fetcher","displayName":"CCTV News Fetcher"},"version":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1770012122426,"changelog":"Initial release: Easily fetches and summarizes CCTV News Broadcast highlights for any given date.\n\n- Fetch summary titles and content from Xinwen Lianbo by date (e.g., \"yesterday\", \"today\", or specific date).\n- Processes user date requests, runs a news crawler script, and parses results for the user.\n- Groups news by \"Domestic\" and \"International\" if possible, or lists key highlights.\n- Requires bun and node-html-parser in the environment.","changelogSource":"user","license":null,"files":[{"path":"package-lock.json","size":6119,"sha256":"51273827d65a86e8a9434724f864e29d10e4cdf57eb34131f64f5bc9025eabc2","contentType":"application/json"},{"path":"package.json","size":215,"sha256":"b4001030818e7b1594a669bb81bae47661a351cefd0869c669f1306006adca68","contentType":"application/json"},{"path":"SKILL.md","size":1045,"sha256":"ab0d3bec09ab5f4c42add9e8b40867b26f37a9df5c35e2fe8d0c33dcedbc620a","contentType":null},{"path":"scripts/news_crawler.js","size":6985,"sha256":"d3f04085cc08a8ad85b9128e8c83a6cec3f1b3296502cd2f8c704fb95bfd2d0a","contentType":"text/javascript"},{"path":"examples/example.md","size":445,"sha256":"bf4672b785cf5a71672712cd8e571a36e175d6c55e24a7f8c676eb0d0f655755","contentType":null},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":2094,"sha256":"5dc3431a22abece99e15d5f92284925fdf01046680fc01393cb775bfbe48ec00","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"suspicious","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1789027893212,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"ba392112ef3c1c46494dd20ca23bfb6ffc1633ecf1dbb396ebdf08ba2dc74724","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/ba392112ef3c1c46494dd20ca23bfb6ffc1633ecf1dbb396ebdf08ba2dc74724","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":"Type: OpenClaw Skill\nName: cctv-news-fetcher\nVersion: 1.0.0\n\nThe skill 'cctv-news-fetcher' is designed to fetch and parse news from CCTV. The `SKILL.md` instructs the agent to execute a local JavaScript script (`scripts/news_crawler.js`) with a date argument. The JavaScript code performs web scraping from official CCTV domains (`cctv.cntv.cn`, `tv.cctv.com`) using `fetch` and `node-html-parser`. There is no evidence of data exfiltration, malicious execution, persistence mechanisms, or prompt injection attempts against the agent. The dependencies listed in `package.json` and `package-lock.json` are standard for HTML parsing and do not raise any concerns.","source":"palm","checkedAt":1779160820769},"skillspector":{"status":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","score":48,"severity":"MEDIUM","recommendation":"CAUTION","issueCount":9,"checkedAt":1789027893212},"llm":{"status":"suspicious","verdict":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","confidence":"high","summary":"The skill has a clear news-fetching purpose, but its crawler follows unvalidated links from remote pages and sends a hard-coded cookie, so users should review it before installing.","dimensions":[{"detail":"Network access is necessary for the stated purpose, but the implementation can make follow-up requests to destinations supplied by fetched pages and forwards a static cna cookie and manual Host header to those requests.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"concern"},{"detail":"The package has a normal npm-style dependency on node-html-parser and includes a lockfile with registry integrity entries. package.json still uses a caret range, which is a supply-chain reproducibility note rather than evidence of malicious behavior.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The instructions tell the agent to execute a local Node/Bun crawler, but they do not document outbound host restrictions, redirect handling, request limits, or the hard-coded request headers used by the script.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"concern"},{"detail":"No artifact evidence shows startup hooks, scheduled tasks, memory writes, credential-store access, privilege escalation, or filesystem mutation.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"Fetching CCTV news by date is coherent with the skill description, and the script does not show local file theft, destructive behavior, or persistence. The concern is that article URLs are taken from remote HTML and fetched without scheme or host validation, which can expand network requests beyond CCTV.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"concern"}],"guidance":"Install only if you are comfortable with the skill running a local JavaScript crawler that makes outbound web requests. Prefer a version that allowlists CCTV hosts, rejects non-HTTPS or unexpected links, removes the hard-coded cookie and Host header, and adds request limits before use in sensitive networks.","findings":"[LP3] expected: Running a local crawler with network access is expected for this skill, but the artifact does not provide explicit permission scoping or host restrictions.\n[SDI-2] unexpected: The scanner concern is supported: the crawler fetches hrefs or regex-extracted URLs from remote CCTV pages without validating scheme, host, port, or redirects.\n[T09] unexpected: The static scan concern is supported by the hard-coded Cookie and Host headers being sent with unvalidated follow-up requests.\n[SC1] expected: The HTML parser dependency is expected for the crawler, and the lockfile pins resolved versions; the caret range in package.json remains a low-level maintenance risk.\n[SQP-3] expected: Chinese examples and zh-CN Accept-Language are coherent with a CCTV Xinwen Lianbo news skill and do not materially affect the security verdict.","agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1789027893212}}}}}